WEBVTT

01:49.350 --> 01:54.950
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.070 --> 01:58.030
[Episode 27]

02:11.630 --> 02:13.030
Why are you staring at me?

02:14.240 --> 02:15.800
What are you scheming now?

02:20.400 --> 02:21.530
I've been thinking.

02:22.560 --> 02:23.340
Song Yimeng,

02:24.800 --> 02:25.710
I like you.

02:29.970 --> 02:30.970
What did you say?

02:32.110 --> 02:33.190
I said I like you.

02:34.750 --> 02:35.560
So,

02:36.000 --> 02:37.400
I want your forgiveness,

02:37.910 --> 02:39.190
and then marry you.

02:42.280 --> 02:42.840
You...

02:43.450 --> 02:44.260
You...

02:44.560 --> 02:46.090
You must be out of your mind!

02:46.360 --> 02:47.680
In your dreams.

02:47.910 --> 02:50.510
Why don't you fly to the moon
while you're at it?

02:50.800 --> 02:52.800
Just let me finish what I have to say.

02:53.800 --> 02:54.990
At first,

02:55.079 --> 02:56.680
I was indeed wary of you.

02:57.360 --> 02:58.120
I even...

03:00.900 --> 03:02.760
I even thought about killing you.

03:03.760 --> 03:05.620
But after spending time with you,

03:06.080 --> 03:07.520
everything has changed.

03:08.140 --> 03:09.990
What change are you talking about?

03:09.990 --> 03:11.560
Let me remind you,

03:11.750 --> 03:12.870
you didn't kill me

03:13.000 --> 03:14.510
because you couldn't.

03:16.070 --> 03:16.870
Yes,

03:17.670 --> 03:19.329
I might not be able to kill you,

03:19.430 --> 03:20.240
but...

03:21.180 --> 03:23.910
But because of that time
at the Lantern Festival,

03:24.840 --> 03:26.380
I fell for you.

03:27.079 --> 03:28.200
Since then,

03:28.520 --> 03:30.780
I never thought about killing you again.

03:36.240 --> 03:37.840
I've been anxious and uneasy

03:39.430 --> 03:41.230
while deceiving you these days.

03:43.280 --> 03:44.410
But there are things

03:45.070 --> 03:46.350
that confuse me.

03:47.400 --> 03:49.130
Why is it that when I'm Nan Heng,

03:49.780 --> 03:51.070
you avoid me,

03:51.430 --> 03:52.240
you're cautious,

03:52.240 --> 03:53.150
you ingratiate yourself,

03:53.150 --> 03:54.210
and act insincere,

03:54.680 --> 03:56.540
but when I put on Li Shiliu's mask,

03:57.190 --> 03:58.470
you treat me with sincerity

03:58.470 --> 03:59.310
and honesty?

04:00.430 --> 04:01.400
No matter which version of me,

04:01.400 --> 04:02.800
I'm sincere with you.

04:03.800 --> 04:05.600
But why does the real Song Yimeng

04:06.000 --> 04:07.710
only appear before Li Shiliu?

04:14.470 --> 04:15.280
So?

04:16.829 --> 04:18.890
Is this your excuse for deceiving me?

04:25.360 --> 04:26.510
I did deceive you.

04:28.390 --> 04:30.190
But that's because I was afraid.

04:30.750 --> 04:33.080
I was afraid that once
the lie was exposed,

04:33.680 --> 04:35.680
I would never see the real you again.

04:37.070 --> 04:37.870
And...

04:40.560 --> 04:41.950
And I was selfish,

04:43.230 --> 04:46.360
because I cherished the feeling of
being trusted by you.

04:47.430 --> 04:49.630
I didn't want to wake up from this dream.

04:55.680 --> 04:56.510
But...

04:59.300 --> 05:01.300
you eventually wake up from dreams.

05:02.070 --> 05:02.870
Lies

05:03.800 --> 05:05.280
will also

05:05.870 --> 05:07.200
be exposed eventually.

05:11.430 --> 05:12.240
That's right.

05:15.230 --> 05:17.380
So now I want to honestly tell you

05:19.160 --> 05:20.390
that the real Nan Heng

05:20.870 --> 05:23.000
isn't the God of Death others speak of,

05:23.800 --> 05:26.600
nor is he a carefree hero
of the martial arts world.

05:27.130 --> 05:28.390
He's just

05:29.300 --> 05:30.140
a cowardly,

05:30.490 --> 05:31.720
selfish man.

05:33.570 --> 05:34.780
Would you accept

05:36.590 --> 05:38.520
this version of me as your husband?

05:58.120 --> 05:58.920
His Highness,

05:59.000 --> 06:00.450
where are you?

06:00.690 --> 06:02.310
I hope you're not in any danger.

06:02.310 --> 06:04.170
Please stay safe, Your Highness.

06:04.310 --> 06:05.240
Mr. Fugui!

06:05.390 --> 06:06.820
There's a body in there!

06:08.310 --> 06:08.950
Sir.

06:08.950 --> 06:09.750
It's in there.

06:16.000 --> 06:16.660
This...

06:16.750 --> 06:18.380
Miss Song's cloak?

06:20.270 --> 06:21.270
Mr. Fugui.

06:21.600 --> 06:22.680
Mr. Fugui.

06:23.720 --> 06:24.480
I found signs of struggle

06:24.480 --> 06:26.090
at the edge of the cliff.

06:28.780 --> 06:29.580
Let's go.

06:36.409 --> 06:37.210
I'm sorry.

06:40.390 --> 06:42.050
I can't accept your proposal.

06:46.310 --> 06:48.240
What are you really worried about?

06:52.270 --> 06:53.120
Nan Heng,

06:54.350 --> 06:55.750
let me ask you something.

06:56.270 --> 06:57.870
When you left the cold palace

06:59.100 --> 07:00.750
and went to the border,

07:01.070 --> 07:02.930
what was going through your mind?

07:05.610 --> 07:08.010
I just didn't want to die
in the cold palace.

07:08.240 --> 07:10.600
I wanted to fight for my survival.

07:13.160 --> 07:13.960
That's right.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.120
You succeeded.

07:16.870 --> 07:18.400
You earned military merits

07:18.870 --> 07:19.750
and gradually

07:20.160 --> 07:21.870
built your own power base.

07:23.120 --> 07:25.180
But when you returned to the capital,

07:25.510 --> 07:26.770
you suddenly realized

07:27.870 --> 07:30.130
that your years of fighting at the border

07:31.070 --> 07:33.000
had become completely worthless.

07:34.590 --> 07:37.050
No matter how many
achievements you earned,

07:37.430 --> 07:39.030
the position of crown prince

07:40.070 --> 07:41.720
would only belong to Nan Rui.

07:43.310 --> 07:44.560
And your fate?

07:45.610 --> 07:47.610
To return to the depths of the palace

07:48.120 --> 07:49.450
and never be free again.

07:51.040 --> 07:52.100
So at that moment,

07:53.159 --> 07:54.490
what were you thinking?

07:57.750 --> 08:00.990
If you had ever experienced
trying with all your might

08:01.040 --> 08:02.390
to reach the peak

08:03.000 --> 08:04.980
but never being able to get there,

08:05.080 --> 08:07.150
then you should understand

08:07.750 --> 08:09.880
that enjoying the view from the bottom

08:09.950 --> 08:11.210
isn't so bad after all.

08:14.010 --> 08:15.180
You're trying to say

08:15.870 --> 08:17.670
that no matter how hard one tries,

08:17.670 --> 08:19.330
some things can't be changed.

08:27.990 --> 08:29.390
But I don't believe that.

08:30.060 --> 08:32.590
Why should my fate be
in someone else's hands?

08:33.159 --> 08:34.400
I will obtain

08:35.360 --> 08:37.510
what I want through my own efforts.

08:40.520 --> 08:42.789
But the day you get what you want

08:43.190 --> 08:44.560
will be the day

08:45.750 --> 08:47.610
tragedy befalls the Song family.

08:49.270 --> 08:50.430
When I was little,

08:51.510 --> 08:53.630
there was a terrible fire.

08:55.870 --> 08:57.000
My parents

08:57.780 --> 08:59.170
left this world forever

09:01.480 --> 09:03.270
because they saved me.

09:04.360 --> 09:05.370
So

09:06.480 --> 09:08.360
I will never allow such a tragedy

09:09.270 --> 09:10.570
happen again.

09:11.390 --> 09:13.480
What do you mean your parents left?

09:14.310 --> 09:16.270
Isn't Mr. Song perfectly fine?

09:16.920 --> 09:19.120
I don't understand what you're saying.

09:23.090 --> 09:24.050
It's nothing.

09:24.750 --> 09:26.210
You wouldn't understand.

09:29.270 --> 09:30.120
Nan Heng,

09:31.830 --> 09:32.990
there will

09:34.270 --> 09:36.310
never be a happy ending for us.

09:43.160 --> 09:45.160
Since there can't be a happy ending,

09:45.870 --> 09:46.870
it's better

09:47.480 --> 09:49.070
if we never begin at all.

09:52.590 --> 09:53.480
So

09:55.030 --> 09:57.090
this is your reason for rejecting me?

10:02.870 --> 10:03.870
But Song Yimeng,

10:05.080 --> 10:06.320
have you even tried?

10:07.120 --> 10:08.390
Nothing has even begun,

10:08.390 --> 10:10.050
so why say it's doomed to fail?

10:10.790 --> 10:12.720
If I'm the problem, I can change.

10:12.910 --> 10:14.450
I can promise you

10:14.480 --> 10:16.390
to show you my true self from now on,

10:16.390 --> 10:18.200
and I'll look after the Song family too.

10:18.200 --> 10:19.200
But why are you using

10:19.200 --> 10:20.150
a made-up excuse

10:20.240 --> 10:21.390
to reject me?

10:26.400 --> 10:28.800
Your Highness doesn't need to understand.

10:28.910 --> 10:29.990
This world

10:30.480 --> 10:32.360
is just one giant storybook.

10:33.270 --> 10:34.080
And I

10:34.890 --> 10:36.420
am just an ordinary person.

10:38.270 --> 10:39.320
I only want

10:39.350 --> 10:40.620
to protect my family,

10:41.660 --> 10:43.610
to keep them alive and well.

10:44.790 --> 10:46.320
The only thing I can control

10:47.910 --> 10:49.120
is my own heart.

10:53.020 --> 10:54.100
So, Your Highness,

10:56.080 --> 10:58.080
the Song Yimeng standing before you

10:58.380 --> 10:59.520
will never

11:00.480 --> 11:02.280
and cannot fall in love with you.

11:09.480 --> 11:10.540
Then let me ask you.

11:12.150 --> 11:13.680
If you're so afraid of death

11:13.870 --> 11:14.790
and pain,

11:16.030 --> 11:18.760
why did you risk everything
to save me last night?

11:21.600 --> 11:22.560
Song Yimeng,

11:24.440 --> 11:25.320
can you really

11:26.210 --> 11:27.690
control your heart?

11:42.260 --> 11:43.120
General.

11:55.030 --> 11:57.330
[Song Residence]

11:58.490 --> 12:00.870
You actually snuck out

12:01.080 --> 12:02.810
without telling me last night?

12:05.030 --> 12:06.550
They tried killing you
and you fell off a cliff.

12:06.550 --> 12:07.510
All of this

12:07.530 --> 12:09.130
happened in one short night.

12:09.200 --> 12:09.870
Mr. Song.

12:09.870 --> 12:10.510
I...

12:10.610 --> 12:11.610
Miss Song Yiting,

12:12.480 --> 12:13.740
last night the two of us

12:14.080 --> 12:16.410
were pursued by nearly 100 assassins.

12:16.460 --> 12:17.750
We had nowhere to retreat

12:17.750 --> 12:19.140
and were forced to the edge of a cliff.

12:19.140 --> 12:20.910
In the end, we barely managed to survive

12:20.910 --> 12:22.770
by choosing to jump off the cliff.

12:23.680 --> 12:24.730
Look,

12:24.920 --> 12:26.610
I even suffered a knife wound.

12:28.480 --> 12:30.080
You were still in the capital

12:30.270 --> 12:31.910
and people dared to be so brazen.

12:31.910 --> 12:32.430
Shut up.

12:32.430 --> 12:34.440
They even dared to
hurt the Seventh Prince.

12:34.440 --> 12:36.240
Thankfully the Seventh Prince
arrived in time,

12:36.240 --> 12:37.240
otherwise Yimeng

12:37.470 --> 12:39.070
might have already...

12:39.270 --> 12:40.080
It wasn't that serious.

12:40.080 --> 12:40.630
Father,

12:40.630 --> 12:41.560
wasn't serious.

12:41.910 --> 12:44.640
How can you say it wasn't serious
when all this happened?

12:44.640 --> 12:46.200
Mr. Song is right.

12:46.440 --> 12:47.240
Those assassins

12:47.240 --> 12:48.480
were all highly skilled fighters

12:48.480 --> 12:49.630
with ruthless techniques.

12:49.630 --> 12:50.800
Even I,

12:51.080 --> 12:53.150
a veteran of many battles, nearly died,

12:53.150 --> 12:54.550
let alone her.

12:54.550 --> 12:55.240
Nan Heng.

12:55.630 --> 12:56.800
are you done?

12:57.030 --> 12:58.830
Stop exaggerating everything.

13:00.030 --> 13:00.960
What do you mean?

13:02.510 --> 13:03.150
Father,

13:03.270 --> 13:04.390
don't listen to him.

13:04.390 --> 13:05.960
It wasn't nearly as bad as he claims.

13:05.960 --> 13:07.200
If it were really that serious,

13:07.200 --> 13:08.510
how would I still be alive to return?

13:08.510 --> 13:09.120
Think about it.

13:09.120 --> 13:09.790
Even so,

13:09.790 --> 13:11.270
it must have been extremely dangerous.

13:11.270 --> 13:13.150
Otherwise, with how skilled the
Seventh Prince is,

13:13.150 --> 13:14.440
how could he get hurt?

13:14.910 --> 13:16.000
Yiting makes a good point.

13:16.000 --> 13:16.670
Well...

13:17.080 --> 13:18.960
You are not allowed to go south anymore.

13:18.960 --> 13:20.620
Stay put in the capital.

13:20.840 --> 13:22.320
Father, don't believe everything you hear.

13:22.320 --> 13:23.870
Mr. Song, your thinking is prudent,

13:23.870 --> 13:25.870
but since these villains failed this time,

13:25.870 --> 13:28.550
they will surely seek
another opportunity to strike.

13:28.550 --> 13:29.670
I just wonder

13:29.700 --> 13:31.130
what method they'll use.

13:31.480 --> 13:32.410
Strangulation,

13:32.510 --> 13:33.600
an ambush,

13:33.720 --> 13:35.440
or perhaps poison?

13:35.440 --> 13:36.150
Enough!

13:38.240 --> 13:38.790
Yimeng.

13:38.870 --> 13:39.910
To be safe,

13:40.320 --> 13:41.270
from today on,

13:42.000 --> 13:43.390
you must stay in the Song Residence

13:43.390 --> 13:44.690
and not leave at all.

13:45.480 --> 13:46.080
Father,

13:46.150 --> 13:47.370
this is unnecessary.

13:47.440 --> 13:48.370
Father is right.

13:48.600 --> 13:50.120
We cannot take this lightly.

13:50.120 --> 13:52.120
Just staying indoors isn't enough.

13:52.270 --> 13:53.440
Think about it, Mr. Song.

13:53.440 --> 13:55.830
If they could bribe your stable hand,

13:56.000 --> 13:57.510
then it's possible

13:57.510 --> 13:59.710
they have spies within your household.

14:00.200 --> 14:01.000
Quick,

14:01.000 --> 14:01.750
guards!

14:02.150 --> 14:03.390
Add more guards to the residence

14:03.390 --> 14:04.870
and watch Laiyi House around the clock.

14:04.870 --> 14:05.670
Yes, sir.

14:06.150 --> 14:07.080
Yimeng,

14:07.200 --> 14:08.390
starting today,

14:08.480 --> 14:09.990
you must stay in your room

14:10.020 --> 14:11.950
and not take a single step outside.

14:12.840 --> 14:13.630
Father,

14:13.650 --> 14:15.200
how can I not leave my room?

14:15.200 --> 14:16.320
It's really not that serious.

14:16.320 --> 14:17.440
Don't listen to him.

14:17.440 --> 14:17.910
This is truly unnecessary.

14:17.910 --> 14:19.000
Your Highness,

14:19.020 --> 14:20.320
please find the real culprit quickly

14:20.320 --> 14:22.380
so our household can return to peace.

14:22.390 --> 14:23.000
Of course.

14:23.000 --> 14:24.310
I'll do my best.

14:24.670 --> 14:25.510
However, Miss Song Yiting

14:25.510 --> 14:26.470
and Mr. Song,

14:26.630 --> 14:27.960
you both need to be

14:28.320 --> 14:29.750
careful when going out from now on too.

14:29.750 --> 14:30.200
Yes, of course.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.240
Is this his house

14:31.240 --> 14:32.320
or mine?

14:32.320 --> 14:34.060
Why do you all believe him?

14:34.270 --> 14:36.120
Be a good girl.

14:39.030 --> 14:40.480
Making a big show,

14:40.600 --> 14:41.510
blowing things out of proportion.

14:41.510 --> 14:43.360
I know you're up to no good.

14:43.440 --> 14:44.240
Song Yimeng.

14:44.790 --> 14:46.310
Stop following me.

14:46.440 --> 14:47.970
You're going the wrong way.

14:50.440 --> 14:51.240
I...

14:52.390 --> 14:53.840
Don't think I don't know

14:53.840 --> 14:55.150
what you were trying to do

14:55.150 --> 14:56.630
by saying those things to my family.

14:56.630 --> 14:58.360
You may have trapped me for now,

14:58.480 --> 15:00.140
but you can't trap me forever.

15:00.270 --> 15:02.390
Isn't everything I've done
for your own good?

15:02.390 --> 15:04.210
Your enemy hasn't revealed themselves yet.

15:04.210 --> 15:06.360
We absolutely can't let our guard down.

15:06.360 --> 15:07.200
Enemy?

15:07.670 --> 15:09.390
What enemy are you talking about?

15:09.390 --> 15:10.440
That was just an iconic scene

15:10.440 --> 15:12.370
from the script that had to happen.

15:12.550 --> 15:13.790
Besides,

15:14.120 --> 15:15.750
apart from you, what enemies

15:16.000 --> 15:17.580
can I possibly have?

15:17.900 --> 15:18.930
Move.

15:19.200 --> 15:20.000
Your Highness!

15:20.000 --> 15:20.480
Song Yimeng.

15:20.480 --> 15:21.200
Your Highness,

15:21.200 --> 15:22.080
something terrible has happened!

15:22.080 --> 15:23.280
Something terrible!

15:23.790 --> 15:24.720
What happened?

15:31.720 --> 15:33.810
Where on earth has the General gone?

15:34.000 --> 15:34.840
Indeed,

15:35.000 --> 15:36.550
something this serious
has happened to the Chancellor,

15:36.550 --> 15:38.000
yet the General isn't even
at his residence.

15:38.000 --> 15:38.800
What do you...

15:39.870 --> 15:40.440
General.

15:40.440 --> 15:40.970
General.

15:42.080 --> 15:42.670
General,

15:42.840 --> 15:44.150
you're finally back.

15:44.630 --> 15:45.440
General,

15:45.630 --> 15:46.510
regarding the Chancellor's matter,

15:46.510 --> 15:48.170
we need you to make a decision.

15:49.240 --> 15:50.030
Yan Yi.

15:51.270 --> 15:52.140
What is

15:52.610 --> 15:54.200
the Ministry of Justice's judgment?

15:54.200 --> 15:55.000
General,

15:55.790 --> 15:57.120
Chancellor Gao's body was

15:57.120 --> 15:59.750
immediately taken to the capital
prefecture's office by Mr. Chu last night.

15:59.750 --> 16:00.630
Early this morning,

16:00.630 --> 16:02.670
Mr. Chu went to the palace
to report to His Majesty.

16:02.670 --> 16:04.440
During this time, the Ministry of Justice
had no chance

16:04.440 --> 16:06.040
to intervene in this matter.

16:07.510 --> 16:08.480
Yao Qian,

16:08.960 --> 16:10.150
didn't I order you to keep constant watch

16:10.150 --> 16:11.510
on the Qianyu Army's movements?

16:11.510 --> 16:13.840
Why did you let Chu Guihong
get ahead of us?

16:14.000 --> 16:14.860
Your Highness.

16:15.360 --> 16:16.150
I mean,

16:16.720 --> 16:17.510
General.

16:18.290 --> 16:20.290
I followed your orders diligently,

16:20.360 --> 16:21.550
working conscientiously

16:21.550 --> 16:22.750
and with utmost care.

16:22.870 --> 16:23.800
Get to the point.

16:24.750 --> 16:25.550
However,

16:26.000 --> 16:27.910
what was unexpected was that

16:27.930 --> 16:29.870
last night, General Chu and Rong Hua

16:29.870 --> 16:32.270
suddenly went to
bid farewell to Chancellor Gao.

16:32.270 --> 16:33.620
As they were parting ways,

16:33.620 --> 16:35.000
something unexpected happened,

16:35.000 --> 16:37.700
and several people lost their lives.

16:38.750 --> 16:41.150
He told you to get to the point.
Are you deaf?

16:42.960 --> 16:45.200
By the time I heard the news,

16:45.200 --> 16:46.790
we had already lost our advantage,

16:46.790 --> 16:49.360
and the case had fallen
into the capital prefect's hands.

16:49.360 --> 16:50.840
I made the quick decision

16:50.840 --> 16:52.120
to return and report to you.

16:52.120 --> 16:52.920
But Your High—

16:53.870 --> 16:57.000
General's whereabouts were
unknown at that time.

16:57.670 --> 16:58.630
As they say,

16:59.360 --> 17:02.240
losing the commander
during battle is disastrous.

17:02.240 --> 17:03.100
That's enough.

17:03.910 --> 17:04.720
Go now

17:05.160 --> 17:06.480
and find the Gao family.

17:06.480 --> 17:08.160
Tell them to go to the
capital prefecture's office

17:08.160 --> 17:09.440
as next of kin

17:09.720 --> 17:11.480
to claim Chancellor Gao's body.

17:11.480 --> 17:12.270
Yes, sir.

17:18.369 --> 17:19.260
General,

17:19.550 --> 17:22.349
Chu Guihong's behavior in this matter
is quite suspicious.

17:22.349 --> 17:23.640
He bid farewell to the Chancellor,

17:23.640 --> 17:25.349
then requested an audience
with His Majesty.

17:25.349 --> 17:27.109
I fear he may be plotting something

17:27.109 --> 17:28.310
that could harm you.

17:28.630 --> 17:29.430
General,

17:29.450 --> 17:30.430
why don't we

17:30.550 --> 17:31.750
strike first

17:31.840 --> 17:33.550
and use the Chancellor's death

17:33.550 --> 17:34.960
to deal a heavy blow to Chu Guihong?

17:34.960 --> 17:36.000
Yes, General.

17:36.350 --> 17:39.270
Since General Chu met with
the Chancellor last night,

17:39.270 --> 17:40.640
we could use this opportunity

17:40.640 --> 17:42.480
to accuse him of failing to save a life,

17:42.480 --> 17:44.680
deliberately allowing those villains

17:44.680 --> 17:46.000
to assassinate a high-level official

17:46.000 --> 17:47.680
right under the Emperor's nose.

17:47.680 --> 17:49.110
If we can use this to
charge the Qianyu Army

17:49.110 --> 17:50.440
with negligence in their duties,

17:50.440 --> 17:51.480
then the Chancellor's death

17:51.480 --> 17:53.070
actually works in our favor.

17:53.070 --> 17:54.240
That makes sense.

17:54.960 --> 17:56.280
Exactly.

17:59.110 --> 17:59.720
General,

18:00.310 --> 18:02.640
Chancellor Gao's death is irreversible.

18:02.750 --> 18:04.550
Please accept our condolences.

18:04.550 --> 18:06.200
But right now, maintaining

18:06.200 --> 18:08.070
the political balance that Chancellor Gao
worked so hard to establish

18:08.070 --> 18:09.500
is of paramount importance.

18:09.500 --> 18:10.640
No matter what,

18:10.640 --> 18:12.170
you still have us.

18:12.270 --> 18:12.790
Yes,

18:12.790 --> 18:13.510
-Yes.
-Yes.

18:13.510 --> 18:14.200
Enough.

18:14.730 --> 18:16.440
I'll make my own judgment on this matter.

18:16.440 --> 18:17.640
You may all leave now.

18:19.000 --> 18:19.510
Yes.

18:19.510 --> 18:20.550
-Yes.
-Yes.

18:28.200 --> 18:29.930
How quickly loyalties change.

18:30.000 --> 18:31.200
When Chancellor Gao was alive,

18:31.200 --> 18:32.750
these people were falling over themselves

18:32.750 --> 18:33.850
to follow his every command.

18:33.850 --> 18:34.570
And now?

18:35.350 --> 18:37.110
He's passed away less than 24 hours ago,

18:37.110 --> 18:38.840
and they've completely changed their tune.

18:38.840 --> 18:40.200
A matter of life and death

18:40.200 --> 18:42.800
shouldn't be used as
a pawn in power struggles.

18:43.000 --> 18:44.260
This is all too common.

18:44.920 --> 18:46.050
In power struggles,

18:46.310 --> 18:48.240
how much sincerity can you expect?

18:50.720 --> 18:51.510
By the way,

18:52.200 --> 18:53.960
what's the progress on investigating
those men in black?

18:53.960 --> 18:55.590
And who set up those traps in the cave?

18:55.590 --> 18:56.950
Any leads?

18:57.270 --> 18:58.830
Well, we're still investigating about

18:58.830 --> 18:59.890
those men in black,

19:00.400 --> 19:02.720
but those weapons and
rope traps in the cave

19:02.720 --> 19:04.580
were placed there on your orders.

19:05.590 --> 19:06.510
I ordered it?

19:07.480 --> 19:08.910
What do you mean I ordered it?

19:08.910 --> 19:10.240
I just found out myself.

19:10.920 --> 19:11.790
Two years ago,

19:11.790 --> 19:13.310
when Waning River Crescent
was at risk of being exposed,

19:13.310 --> 19:14.510
you used Li Shiliu's identity

19:14.510 --> 19:15.680
to order Yunlong and Shanhu

19:15.680 --> 19:17.990
to move the weapons hidden in the hall.

19:18.350 --> 19:20.070
They didn't know your real identity then.

19:20.070 --> 19:20.750
Yunlong

19:20.750 --> 19:23.060
found that cave in Huyang Forest

19:23.270 --> 19:24.480
and stored everything there.

19:24.480 --> 19:25.110
And Shanhu

19:25.110 --> 19:27.380
copied the Xuanjia Army's techniques

19:27.510 --> 19:29.030
to set up those rope traps

19:29.030 --> 19:30.420
to throw off suspicion.

19:30.720 --> 19:32.290
They planned that
if it were ever discovered,

19:32.290 --> 19:33.620
they would pin it on you.

19:34.880 --> 19:36.400
Why pin it on me?

19:36.750 --> 19:38.270
Well, you're known as
the God of Death.

19:38.270 --> 19:38.920
I...

19:42.330 --> 19:45.190
So just because I'm the God of Death,
I deserve this?

19:49.240 --> 19:50.000
Enough.

19:50.550 --> 19:52.810
Stop investigating the men in black too.

19:53.240 --> 19:54.000
Right now,

19:54.350 --> 19:56.510
go immediately to the
capital prefecture's office

19:56.510 --> 19:57.910
and pressure Chu Guihong

19:58.100 --> 20:00.300
to release Shangguan He and the others.

20:03.160 --> 20:03.960
Yes.

20:06.110 --> 20:07.680
Won't let me investigate the assassins.

20:07.680 --> 20:09.720
All he cares about is
Shangguan the Useless.

20:09.720 --> 20:10.720
Such favoritism.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.260
Are you saying

20:15.200 --> 20:17.080
Heng killed Gao Changyin?

20:17.240 --> 20:18.000
Yes.

20:28.240 --> 20:29.070
I suspect that

20:29.340 --> 20:31.250
the Seventh Prince had a conflict

20:31.270 --> 20:33.350
with Chancellor Gao over
the Jiangnan case

20:33.350 --> 20:34.750
and feared that someday,

20:34.790 --> 20:36.680
Chancellor Gao would
expose his misconduct

20:36.680 --> 20:37.830
during the Pingrong Battle

20:37.830 --> 20:38.920
to the world,

20:39.450 --> 20:41.650
so he simply silenced him permanently.

20:44.590 --> 20:46.240
I humbly request Your Majesty

20:46.240 --> 20:48.440
to reinvestigate the Pingrong Battle.

20:55.670 --> 20:57.550
This is a matter of great importance.

20:57.550 --> 20:59.820
Gao Changyin's dying words alone

20:59.850 --> 21:01.460
are not sufficient evidence.

21:01.460 --> 21:04.400
To reopen and review
the entire Pingrong incident

21:04.510 --> 21:05.970
requires concrete proof.

21:06.240 --> 21:06.920
For now,

21:07.000 --> 21:08.480
you should first investigate

21:08.480 --> 21:10.110
who killed Gao Changyin.

21:10.110 --> 21:11.790
If it was indeed Heng's doing,

21:12.200 --> 21:14.070
I will make my own judgment.

21:20.160 --> 21:21.510
I will thoroughly investigate

21:21.510 --> 21:22.920
both cases to the end.

21:23.300 --> 21:25.770
Once I find compelling evidence
about the Pingrong Battle,

21:25.770 --> 21:27.400
I will vindicate my father

21:27.510 --> 21:28.880
and the Qianyu Army.

21:29.270 --> 21:30.150
At that time,

21:30.550 --> 21:32.290
Your Majesty can take this opportunity

21:32.290 --> 21:33.690
to completely eliminate

21:33.960 --> 21:35.690
Nan Heng's influence in court.

21:39.240 --> 21:39.750
Ten!

21:39.750 --> 21:40.240
Fifteen!

21:40.240 --> 21:40.590
Ten!

21:40.590 --> 21:41.350
Fifteen!

21:41.350 --> 21:42.160
Ten, ten!

21:42.160 --> 21:42.720
Fifteen!

21:42.830 --> 21:43.590
Twenty!

21:45.160 --> 21:45.920
That doesn't count!

21:45.920 --> 21:46.920
Let's start over.

21:47.000 --> 21:47.640
Again! Let's go!

21:47.640 --> 21:48.400
Ten!

21:48.400 --> 21:49.110
Twenty!

21:49.110 --> 21:49.640
-Twenty!
-Nothing!

21:49.640 --> 21:50.240
Nothing!

21:50.240 --> 21:51.030
Open!

21:51.680 --> 21:52.440
I won again!

21:52.440 --> 21:53.000
I won again!

21:53.000 --> 21:53.750
General.

21:53.750 --> 21:54.550
Keep playing.

21:54.720 --> 21:55.720
I'm tired. Come.

21:56.510 --> 21:58.940
The prison release has been arranged.

21:57.960 --> 22:00.200
[Capital Prefecture's Office received
an imperial edict today.]

21:59.000 --> 22:00.440
Shangguan Baihe and the others

22:00.440 --> 22:01.830
can be freed at any time.

22:06.260 --> 22:08.520
Take them back to Waning River Crescent,

22:08.590 --> 22:10.240
and use this opportunity

22:10.350 --> 22:11.820
to investigate the organization

22:11.520 --> 22:12.590
[Capital Prefecture's Office received
an imperial edict today.]

22:12.200 --> 22:14.660
and check every Nightwalker's background.

22:15.940 --> 22:17.280
What is the purpose

22:18.310 --> 22:19.540
of this, General?

22:19.780 --> 22:22.910
Nan Heng orchestrated
the Pingrong Battle conspiracy,

22:23.020 --> 22:24.300
but all records in the Qianyu Army

22:24.300 --> 22:26.950
of my request for reinforcements that day

22:26.970 --> 22:28.580
were completely destroyed.

22:29.390 --> 22:30.300
This must be

22:30.980 --> 22:33.890
because his men who
infiltrated the Qianyu Army

22:34.030 --> 22:35.310
tampered with the evidence,

22:35.310 --> 22:37.930
and then pretended to have died in battle

22:37.950 --> 22:39.220
to escape.

22:39.750 --> 22:41.350
General, are you suggesting

22:42.640 --> 22:43.930
that these fugitives

22:44.200 --> 22:47.000
might be hiding
within the Waning River Crescent?

22:48.000 --> 22:48.830
If they're not hiding among

22:48.830 --> 22:50.880
these mysterious Nightwalkers,

22:51.250 --> 22:52.800
where else would they be?

22:56.500 --> 22:58.160
Someone's coming, brothers!

23:00.310 --> 23:01.830
Isn't this Mr. Chu?

23:01.850 --> 23:03.960
Why have you come to see us personally?

23:03.960 --> 23:05.550
Nan Heng traded 60 lashes

23:05.550 --> 23:07.460
to save the Waning River Crescent.

23:07.460 --> 23:08.850
You're free to go now.

23:09.030 --> 23:10.170
This way, please.

23:20.540 --> 23:21.770
You should

23:22.270 --> 23:24.070
take my advice to heart.

23:24.410 --> 23:25.340
If you trust him,

23:25.920 --> 23:26.880
you'll suffer.

23:30.050 --> 23:31.610
The last death row meal

23:31.960 --> 23:33.510
didn't quite satisfy you.

23:34.210 --> 23:36.810
Whenever you're ready
to come over to our side,

23:37.030 --> 23:39.960
I'll prepare the finest food and wine
to welcome you.

23:40.000 --> 23:40.830
And then,

23:41.250 --> 23:42.780
I'll invite you

23:43.550 --> 23:45.400
to enjoy a few more pig trotters.

23:47.440 --> 23:49.240
I'll pass on that death row meal.

23:49.640 --> 23:51.500
I'm tired of pig trotters anyway.

23:52.030 --> 23:52.830
However,

23:53.060 --> 23:55.570
if you ever wish to
put aside our grievances

23:55.750 --> 23:57.350
and value peace,

23:57.510 --> 24:00.480
the doors of Waning River Crescent
will always be open to you.

24:00.480 --> 24:01.680
When that time comes,

24:01.830 --> 24:04.030
I'll slaughter a fine pig

24:04.050 --> 24:05.180
and treat you well.

24:10.970 --> 24:13.750
[Capital Prefecture's Office]

24:25.150 --> 24:28.210
[Capital Prefecture's Office]

24:26.030 --> 24:27.200
Let's go.

24:31.140 --> 24:31.940
Come here.

24:35.810 --> 24:36.990
Wait, wait, wait.

24:37.010 --> 24:38.400
If you still suspect I'm guilty,

24:38.400 --> 24:39.830
you can take me back
to jail for more questioning.

24:39.830 --> 24:41.090
Interrogate me again!

24:42.520 --> 24:43.740
Are you crazy?

24:44.700 --> 24:45.800
You scared me.

24:46.640 --> 24:47.940
Don't give up!

24:55.310 --> 24:56.590
Don't make me

24:56.590 --> 24:57.830
say it a third time.

24:58.310 --> 24:59.000
Come here!

25:06.510 --> 25:07.970
Everyone stand properly.

25:16.480 --> 25:18.110
We're starting with you.

25:19.350 --> 25:20.160
Name?

25:21.240 --> 25:22.160
Duan Shanhu.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.030
Age?

25:24.200 --> 25:25.250
Twenty.

25:25.790 --> 25:26.850
Where are you from?

25:27.350 --> 25:28.070
Pianzhou.

25:28.540 --> 25:35.980
[Unmatched Grace]

25:39.030 --> 25:40.430
You'd better cooperate.

25:46.470 --> 25:47.590
Square lips,

25:47.590 --> 25:48.550
no mustache,

25:48.550 --> 25:49.880
large ears with hanging lobes,

25:49.880 --> 25:50.750
prominent brow bone,

25:50.750 --> 25:53.640
left eyebrow tail slightly
higher than the right

25:54.440 --> 25:55.300
by half an inch.

25:55.900 --> 25:57.390
Are you done yet?

25:57.510 --> 25:58.510
Our hall

25:58.510 --> 25:59.870
only has this many people.

25:59.870 --> 26:01.240
You're registering everyone

26:01.240 --> 26:02.640
and asking about our backgrounds.

26:02.640 --> 26:06.170
Did you bring us back just to
check our household registration?

26:06.830 --> 26:08.280
Releasing prisoners

26:08.080 --> 26:10.350
[Unmatched Grace]

26:08.640 --> 26:10.110
requires caution.

26:10.750 --> 26:11.590
Plus,

26:11.770 --> 26:13.580
you're all under Nan Heng.

26:15.030 --> 26:15.880
Who knows if

26:15.880 --> 26:17.640
you'll get up to no good
again in the future!

26:17.640 --> 26:18.160
Hey!

26:18.400 --> 26:19.060
Move aside.

26:32.470 --> 26:33.270
What's this?

26:33.830 --> 26:35.000
Your method

26:35.070 --> 26:35.880
is outdated.

26:35.990 --> 26:36.680
This

26:36.880 --> 26:38.180
Excel sheet

26:38.240 --> 26:39.440
was taught by Mrs. Li.

26:45.960 --> 26:46.750
Use it.

26:47.070 --> 26:47.870
Ten taels...

26:49.440 --> 26:50.070
Of gold.

26:50.400 --> 26:51.330
What did you say?

26:51.350 --> 26:52.400
Mrs. Li said

26:52.550 --> 26:54.750
this is called intellectual property.

26:54.830 --> 26:55.790
Don't want to buy it?

26:55.790 --> 26:56.650
Then forget it.

26:59.880 --> 27:00.970
Remember,

27:01.350 --> 27:03.480
you swindled me out of 10 taels of gold.

27:08.120 --> 27:09.090
Ouch!

27:10.510 --> 27:11.720
How can I apply medicine

27:11.720 --> 27:12.810
when you keep moving around?

27:12.810 --> 27:14.470
What kind of medicine is this?

27:14.480 --> 27:16.190
Are you trying to kill me or heal me?

27:16.190 --> 27:17.450
Smart of you to notice.

27:18.350 --> 27:20.000
This is high-quality wound medicine

27:20.000 --> 27:21.510
mixed with high-quality liquor

27:21.510 --> 27:22.960
and high-quality salt.

27:23.470 --> 27:24.290
Perfect

27:24.790 --> 27:26.380
for a lowlife like you.

27:26.890 --> 27:28.350
How did I become a lowlife?

27:39.220 --> 27:40.020
Vulgar,

27:40.510 --> 27:41.310
despicable,

27:41.400 --> 27:41.880
low—

27:41.880 --> 27:43.110
Alright, I get it.

27:44.240 --> 27:44.790
However,

27:45.440 --> 27:46.440
Miss Song Yiting,

27:46.880 --> 27:49.140
I'm happy you came to
pick me up from jail.

27:49.650 --> 27:51.540
But since we're a man and a woman,

27:52.000 --> 27:54.060
you don't need to be so enthusiastic.

27:54.750 --> 27:56.880
For a man like Mr. Shangguan
with no sense of responsibility

27:56.880 --> 27:58.400
who goes back on his word,

27:58.630 --> 28:00.360
I need to keep a close eye on you.

28:02.510 --> 28:03.400
Later,

28:03.440 --> 28:05.170
come with me to meet my parents.

28:05.400 --> 28:06.450
Meet your parents?

28:06.450 --> 28:08.110
The incident at Zijin Pavilion
that ruined my reputation

28:08.110 --> 28:09.200
was caused by you.

28:09.790 --> 28:10.790
You and Nan Heng

28:10.790 --> 28:12.520
need to give me an explanation.

28:13.270 --> 28:14.720
Everyone in the Song family

28:14.720 --> 28:16.720
wants to hear you explain in person.

28:17.240 --> 28:18.520
After all this,

28:19.240 --> 28:20.240
were you really

28:21.050 --> 28:22.180
just toying with me,

28:22.590 --> 28:23.680
or do you actually

28:24.070 --> 28:25.270
intend to marry me?

28:26.720 --> 28:27.590
Marry?

28:51.160 --> 28:54.540
So you suspect Chancellor Gao is behind
the attempt to kill Song Yimeng?

28:54.540 --> 28:56.870
But didn't Chancellor Gao die last night?

28:57.640 --> 28:58.970
Could he still be alive?

28:59.580 --> 29:01.510
You're just now figuring this out?

29:03.440 --> 29:04.440
Fair point.

29:05.000 --> 29:06.260
In the entire capital,

29:06.440 --> 29:07.790
the only person willing
to go to such lengths

29:07.790 --> 29:09.070
to kill Song Yimeng

29:09.070 --> 29:10.470
would be Chancellor Gao.

29:11.160 --> 29:12.480
Now because of the Jiangnan case,

29:12.480 --> 29:14.670
he was convinced that Song Yimeng
made you fall in love

29:14.670 --> 29:15.830
and lose interest in
the crown prince title,

29:15.830 --> 29:17.330
so he wanted to eliminate her quickly.

29:17.330 --> 29:18.290
So,

29:18.480 --> 29:21.000
if he simultaneously targeted
Song Yimeng last night

29:21.000 --> 29:22.270
while staging his own death,

29:22.270 --> 29:23.270
then everything

29:23.270 --> 29:24.310
would make sense.

29:25.160 --> 29:26.670
So Chancellor Gao's power

29:26.920 --> 29:28.790
is far greater than we imagined.

29:29.880 --> 29:31.630
He not only manages
a group of assassins,

29:31.630 --> 29:33.290
but even within the Xuanjia Army,

29:33.290 --> 29:34.790
he has planted people

29:35.350 --> 29:37.400
to help him fake his death and escape.

29:37.400 --> 29:38.590
We must investigate this.

29:38.590 --> 29:39.680
At the very least, we need to find out

29:39.680 --> 29:40.720
how many more hidden forces

29:40.720 --> 29:42.310
Gao Changyin has at his disposal.

29:42.310 --> 29:44.240
If we let this situation
develop unchecked,

29:44.240 --> 29:45.480
I fear that one day,

29:45.480 --> 29:46.590
it might be possible for him to

29:46.590 --> 29:47.920
overthrow the emperor.

29:48.640 --> 29:49.880
Regarding the Xuanjia Army,

29:49.880 --> 29:52.140
I've already sent Fugui to investigate.

29:52.450 --> 29:54.040
But to find Chancellor Gao,

29:54.590 --> 29:56.730
we'll need to employ the Nightwalkers.

29:56.730 --> 29:58.370
But with his people in the Xuanjia Army,

29:58.370 --> 29:59.460
we might alert him to our actions.

29:59.460 --> 30:00.310
How about this?

30:00.310 --> 30:02.710
I'll have Yunlong and Shanhu investigate.

30:04.830 --> 30:05.690
What about you?

30:06.240 --> 30:07.000
Me?

30:08.550 --> 30:10.400
Th-This task isn't really suitable for me.

30:10.400 --> 30:12.310
You know my health isn't good.

30:12.550 --> 30:14.030
I'd fall over in a light breeze.

30:14.030 --> 30:15.110
I'd likely just hold you back

30:15.110 --> 30:16.640
during the investigation.

30:17.000 --> 30:18.000
If I cause any delay,

30:18.000 --> 30:19.880
that would ruin your grand plan.

30:23.110 --> 30:24.040
You have a point.

30:24.240 --> 30:25.030
Indeed.

30:25.350 --> 30:26.160
So,

30:27.110 --> 30:29.310
I'm assigning you to do something else.

30:34.350 --> 30:38.210
[Grace & Elegance]

30:34.480 --> 30:36.310
You've only met the Seventh Prince

30:36.310 --> 30:38.920
and now you want to
discuss our marriage at my home?

30:38.920 --> 30:39.720
What,

30:40.000 --> 30:40.920
is the Seventh Prince

30:40.920 --> 30:42.380
your father or something?

30:43.200 --> 30:44.240
We're all cultured people here.

30:44.240 --> 30:45.900
Such talk is improper.

30:46.160 --> 30:47.270
Marriage is a serious matter

30:47.270 --> 30:48.200
that shouldn't be rushed.

30:48.200 --> 30:49.270
Let's set that aside for now.

30:49.270 --> 30:50.350
However, the Zijin Pavilion incident

30:50.350 --> 30:52.080
was indeed my fault.

30:52.240 --> 30:53.160
I should personally visit

30:53.160 --> 30:54.760
and explain to your parents.

30:55.290 --> 30:56.480
I see it's getting late.

30:56.480 --> 30:57.240
Why don't we

30:57.260 --> 30:58.300
go now?

30:59.750 --> 31:00.750
Did His Highness

31:01.600 --> 31:03.200
send you to my home

31:03.440 --> 31:04.680
with some task?

31:06.070 --> 31:07.080
Don't tell me

31:07.110 --> 31:09.150
he sent you to spy on Yimeng?

31:12.790 --> 31:15.330
Truly the capital's most talented lady.

31:15.590 --> 31:17.590
Everyone says Miss Song Yiting
is brilliantly clever.

31:17.590 --> 31:18.550
Nothing escapes

31:18.550 --> 31:20.270
those beautiful eyes of yours.

31:20.270 --> 31:21.200
So,

31:22.960 --> 31:24.350
would you be willing to help me

31:24.350 --> 31:25.830
with this small favor?

31:26.680 --> 31:27.480
Tell me,

31:27.590 --> 31:29.850
what did His Highness threaten you with?

31:30.000 --> 31:30.790
Cleaning the huge

31:30.790 --> 31:33.000
Waning River Crescent by myself,

31:33.110 --> 31:34.840
or else I'd have to run errands.

31:36.000 --> 31:37.110
Not many options.

31:37.590 --> 31:38.720
Loves cleanliness,

31:38.740 --> 31:39.750
is refined,

31:39.750 --> 31:40.610
and is lazy too.

31:40.810 --> 31:42.720
I never thought you were
this type of person.

31:42.720 --> 31:44.020
You've misunderstood me.

31:44.020 --> 31:44.830
Fine,

31:45.030 --> 31:46.890
I can bring you to the Song family.

31:47.040 --> 31:49.920
I'll add in a guest room
with windows on both sides.

31:50.310 --> 31:51.620
That's too generous.

31:51.680 --> 31:53.000
And two maids,

31:53.030 --> 31:54.640
fashionable clothes, and seasonal dishes

31:54.640 --> 31:55.610
whenever you'd like.

31:55.610 --> 31:56.190
Really?

31:56.400 --> 31:57.680
I'll double your salary

31:57.680 --> 31:58.440
and every month,

31:58.440 --> 31:59.720
you get three days off.

32:01.240 --> 32:01.920
Wait.

32:03.590 --> 32:04.880
With such generous compensation,

32:04.880 --> 32:06.480
what do I have to do in return?

32:10.840 --> 32:12.000
When I call for you,

32:12.060 --> 32:13.590
be at my beck and call.

32:15.440 --> 32:17.000
At your beck and call?

32:21.880 --> 32:24.380
Would you consider taking on
my job as well?

32:24.720 --> 32:25.510
I...

32:27.590 --> 32:28.750
I think I'll pass.

32:29.720 --> 32:31.250
What are you worried about?

32:31.440 --> 32:32.640
The Seventh Prince is extremely powerful.

32:32.640 --> 32:33.830
If he discovers I'm taking on
another side job,

32:33.830 --> 32:34.270
then I'll...

32:34.270 --> 32:35.390
As long as you don't tell him,

32:35.390 --> 32:36.740
he'll never know.

32:38.880 --> 32:39.680
That's true.

32:41.590 --> 32:42.920
What else do I need to do?

32:44.950 --> 32:46.720
You only need to sell your skills,

32:46.720 --> 32:47.680
not your body.

32:48.960 --> 32:50.300
Deal.

32:50.610 --> 32:55.200
[Joy]

32:51.000 --> 32:51.790
My Lady,

32:52.720 --> 32:53.550
I've got the information.

32:53.550 --> 32:54.350
What did you find out?

32:54.350 --> 32:55.070
Last night,

32:55.070 --> 32:56.510
besides the matter between you
and the Seventh Prince,

32:56.510 --> 32:58.000
something major happened in the capital.

32:58.000 --> 32:59.000
Chancellor Gao died.

32:59.000 --> 33:00.270
The Seventh Prince must've rushed out

33:00.270 --> 33:01.630
because of this matter.

33:02.350 --> 33:03.590
Chancellor Gao died?

33:04.720 --> 33:07.330
How could Gao Changyin be dead?

33:07.590 --> 33:08.790
In the original script,

33:08.790 --> 33:09.590
he was supposed to survive to the end

33:09.590 --> 33:12.350
as the main villain who
shared power with Nan Heng.

33:12.350 --> 33:13.950
Now he's dead just like that?

33:14.240 --> 33:15.270
Who told you this?

33:15.350 --> 33:16.440
Is the information reliable?

33:16.440 --> 33:17.510
It's absolutely true.

33:17.510 --> 33:19.310
Hu Da, who works for Master, told me.

33:19.310 --> 33:21.440
He said Master rushed to
the Ministry of Justice,

33:21.440 --> 33:24.570
and his expression changed completely
when he came out.

33:26.010 --> 33:28.020
[Good Virtues]

33:26.350 --> 33:26.830
Father,

33:27.000 --> 33:27.460
Father.

33:29.440 --> 33:31.170
Did Chancellor Gao really die?

33:31.680 --> 33:32.550
Yimeng,

33:33.000 --> 33:35.030
if the Seventh Prince
comes looking for you these days,

33:35.030 --> 33:36.550
you must not see him.

33:37.760 --> 33:38.710
Why?

33:41.240 --> 33:43.240
Although the capital prefecture's office
and the Xuanjia Army

33:43.240 --> 33:44.720
are suppressing the news,

33:45.240 --> 33:46.440
there are many rumors

33:46.640 --> 33:48.440
circulating in the capital,

33:48.640 --> 33:51.440
saying the Seventh Prince
killed Chancellor Gao.

33:53.900 --> 33:55.270
That's absurd.

33:55.550 --> 33:58.000
Nan Heng was with me all last night.

33:58.000 --> 34:00.260
How could he have had time to kill anyone?

34:01.550 --> 34:03.130
The cause of Chancellor Gao's death

34:03.130 --> 34:05.230
was petroleum and thunder bombs.

34:05.680 --> 34:07.270
The prison cart
transporting Chancellor Gao

34:07.270 --> 34:08.630
was coated with petroleum

34:08.630 --> 34:10.590
and detonated by bombs on the way.

34:12.230 --> 34:13.840
More than a dozen people

34:14.710 --> 34:17.239
were instantly turned into
charred corpses.

34:18.150 --> 34:19.400
Petroleum...

34:20.080 --> 34:21.880
Why does that sound so familiar?

34:27.320 --> 34:28.040
This is...

34:28.060 --> 34:28.989
A battle report.

34:31.489 --> 34:33.130
[Report from the Northern Garrison Command
to the Ministry of War]

34:31.800 --> 34:33.590
During last year's border battle,

34:33.590 --> 34:36.340
Heyuan once arranged to battle
His Highness outside Youcheng.

34:36.340 --> 34:37.260
In that battle,

34:37.290 --> 34:39.150
His Highness won a great victory,

34:39.360 --> 34:42.230
and what he used to burn

34:42.250 --> 34:44.850
the enemy's granary was
precisely petroleum.

34:45.250 --> 34:46.409
That's impossible.

34:46.510 --> 34:47.880
Nan Heng isn't that kind of person.

34:47.880 --> 34:50.679
He absolutely couldn't have
killed Gao Changyin.

34:51.940 --> 34:52.790
Yimeng.

34:54.489 --> 34:56.290
Now that Chancellor Gao is dead,

34:56.880 --> 34:58.280
the various factions at court

34:58.280 --> 35:00.340
will certainly make a big issue of it.

35:00.920 --> 35:02.230
If it's proven in the end

35:02.230 --> 35:04.460
that the Seventh Prince
killed Chancellor Gao,

35:04.460 --> 35:06.790
I'm afraid Great Jing will face upheaval.

35:15.840 --> 35:17.440
Mrs. Li's strike was

35:17.440 --> 35:18.270
precise and deadly,

35:18.270 --> 35:19.530
killing with one blow.

35:20.120 --> 35:22.180
Did you notice anything suspicious?

35:23.510 --> 35:24.820
The bones show multiple fractures

35:24.820 --> 35:26.020
that have been reset,

35:26.760 --> 35:28.110
and the muscles are strong.

35:28.110 --> 35:28.920
This person

35:29.230 --> 35:31.590
must be a deliberately trained assassin.

35:39.100 --> 35:40.270
What is it now?

35:42.710 --> 35:43.970
I recognize this mark.

35:54.440 --> 35:55.230
General,

35:55.780 --> 35:58.070
here's all the information on
the Nightwalkers.

35:58.070 --> 36:00.000
We haven't found anyone connected

36:00.000 --> 36:01.060
to the Qianyu Army.

36:01.840 --> 36:04.130
Their backgrounds might be fabricated.

36:04.400 --> 36:05.360
Take some men

36:05.760 --> 36:08.020
and investigate their hometowns again.

36:09.120 --> 36:09.710
Yes, sir.

36:09.730 --> 36:10.600
Guihong.

36:10.880 --> 36:12.480
Look what I've brought you.

36:12.550 --> 36:13.800
This belonged to my mother when...

36:13.800 --> 36:14.660
Your Highness.

36:17.920 --> 36:19.350
How did this happen?

36:19.440 --> 36:20.230
Come here.

36:22.760 --> 36:23.510
What a shame.

36:34.840 --> 36:36.170
What are you looking at?

36:52.230 --> 36:53.030
It's the same.

36:53.880 --> 36:55.080
It's the same fabric.

36:55.480 --> 36:56.860
So what?

36:56.960 --> 36:57.510
Guihong,

36:57.530 --> 36:59.230
it's just an ordinary piece of fabric.

36:59.230 --> 37:01.030
Why are you so worked up about it?

37:01.480 --> 37:02.610
This was the fabric of the Qianyu Army's

37:02.610 --> 37:04.920
winter uniform when we were at the border.

37:04.920 --> 37:05.800
Its owner

37:06.590 --> 37:08.850
might be an old friend of the Qianyu Army.

37:11.710 --> 37:13.440
Aren't you overthinking this?

37:13.810 --> 37:14.950
In recent years,

37:15.110 --> 37:17.280
there's been a lot of trade between
the capital and the border.

37:17.280 --> 37:18.190
Similar clothing

37:18.190 --> 37:20.190
can be purchased in the capital too.

37:20.210 --> 37:22.210
This is fabric for military uniforms.

37:22.210 --> 37:23.330
The border is cold

37:23.710 --> 37:24.530
and during war,

37:24.530 --> 37:26.070
clothes often get damaged.

37:26.230 --> 37:28.530
Father specifically chose
a local coarse hemp

37:28.530 --> 37:30.990
to make winter uniforms
for the Qianyu Army.

37:31.100 --> 37:32.500
Are you saying

37:32.550 --> 37:33.440
these clothes

37:33.440 --> 37:34.970
can't be bought with money?

37:36.160 --> 37:37.080
Your Highness,

37:37.440 --> 37:38.370
where did you buy

37:38.400 --> 37:40.130
that basket of red tangerines?

38:16.310 --> 38:18.510
Trespassing the Kou Gang's territory,

38:19.400 --> 38:21.300
you two must be tired of living.

38:31.900 --> 38:33.460
Who exactly are you people?

38:34.710 --> 38:35.550
Businessmen.

38:36.360 --> 38:37.820
We have a big job right now.

38:38.470 --> 38:39.600
Are you interested?

38:45.280 --> 38:47.480
I've never been one to turn down money.

38:48.070 --> 38:49.280
May I ask what kind

38:49.440 --> 38:51.640
of business you gentlemen have in mind?

38:51.760 --> 38:52.550
Murder.

38:53.290 --> 38:55.050
We need to speak with your boss.

38:56.110 --> 38:57.640
If you want to meet our boss,

38:58.100 --> 38:59.490
this level of sincerity

39:01.630 --> 39:02.760
isn't quite enough.

39:11.730 --> 39:13.460
How about this much sincerity?

39:15.130 --> 39:16.920
I believe you can all tell

39:17.020 --> 39:19.710
that these are things
circulated among the nobility.

39:19.710 --> 39:20.800
If you're smart,

39:20.800 --> 39:21.800
stop wasting time

39:21.890 --> 39:23.620
and make the introduction now.

39:30.650 --> 39:31.960
Tonight at midnight,

39:32.520 --> 39:33.890
I'll bring my boss

39:34.550 --> 39:36.430
to meet you at Jiangsong Forest.

39:36.800 --> 39:37.590
Take a look!

39:37.800 --> 39:39.030
Come take a look!

39:40.110 --> 39:41.000
Fresh vegetables!

39:41.000 --> 39:42.340
Freshly picked!

39:42.880 --> 39:43.620
Come, come!

39:44.960 --> 39:45.800
Step right up!

39:47.070 --> 39:47.670
They're very fresh.

39:47.670 --> 39:48.320
They're just harvested.

39:48.320 --> 39:49.070
See how fresh they are.

39:49.070 --> 39:49.960
They're still moist with dew.

39:49.960 --> 39:53.020
Why would you come to
such a place to buy red tangerines?

39:53.070 --> 39:54.590
Well, every winter,

39:54.590 --> 39:56.830
Mother loved these
Dongting red tangerines.

39:56.830 --> 39:59.090
Since they're not common in the capital,

39:59.110 --> 40:01.110
I had people search around for them.

40:02.630 --> 40:05.230
But I don't see anyone
selling red tangerines.

40:05.520 --> 40:07.800
Jixiang said he bought them
at the South City market.

40:07.800 --> 40:08.930
I don't really know.

40:12.630 --> 40:13.440
Guihong,

40:13.440 --> 40:14.230
see?

40:14.480 --> 40:16.110
How much are these red tangerines?

40:16.110 --> 40:16.920
Try one.

40:19.020 --> 40:21.130
[The 4th day of the Pingrong Battle]

40:23.400 --> 40:24.280
Lu Yi.

40:24.830 --> 40:27.700
[Lu Yi,
Scout of the Six Camps of Qianyu Army]

40:25.030 --> 40:26.230
Four hundred li southeast of here

40:26.230 --> 40:28.030
is Youcheng,
where the Xuanjia Army is stationed.

40:28.030 --> 40:29.590
You must deliver this letter,

40:29.590 --> 40:30.440
understand?

40:30.920 --> 40:32.050
But Junior General,

40:32.400 --> 40:33.900
if Seventh Prince were willing
to send troops,

40:33.900 --> 40:34.860
he would have done so already.

40:34.860 --> 40:35.920
Why would things be like this now?

40:35.920 --> 40:37.120
Consider this letter

40:37.670 --> 40:39.110
as my last attempt.

40:51.710 --> 40:52.710
Where are you going, Guihong?

40:52.710 --> 40:53.510
Wait for me!

41:18.800 --> 41:20.340
You're clearly still alive.

41:20.340 --> 41:21.840
Why haven't you come to see me?
